  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_560350.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/all-the-compatibility?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix=%20&style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/560350(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Supported Versions\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"400\"/><br>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n\n## 📖 简介\n\n本模组旨在通过补全所有可用矿石的缺失配方，并尽可能让 [AllTheOres](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ato) 的矿石/锭/粉……被充分利用，从而实现与各类科技模组机器的兼容！\n\n告别5种不同的锡锭或配方缺失的问题！\n\n### 新增超过3000种配方！\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 📷 预览\n\n![review_pic_1](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/review_1.png?raw=true)\n\n![review_pic_2](https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/review_2.png?raw=true)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🗃️ 依赖项\n\n### 必需：\n- **[All the Ores][ato]**\n  - 高炉、熔炉、锻造台、粉末转换配方、结块转换配方\n### 支持：\n- **[Assembly Line Machines][alm]**\n  - 研磨机、合金冶炼炉、流体槽、流体搅拌机、金属成型机、气动压机\n- **[Create][create]**\n  - 粉碎轮、搅拌机、压力机、合成器、批量吹炼、批量清洗、漏斗\n- **[Voluminous Energy][ve]**\n  - 破碎机、离心分离、内爆压缩机、工业高炉\n- **[Industrial Reborn][ir]**\n  - 破碎机、压缩机、合金冶炼炉、锤子、扫描仪、轧机、废料盒、矿石清洗\n- **[FTB Industrial Contraptions][ic]**\n  - 粉碎机、挤出机、离心机、轧机\n- **[Energized Power][ep]**\n  - 粉碎机、合金炉、压缩机、金属压模、过滤厂、晶体生长室、流体转换器\n- **[Modern Industrialization][mi]**\n  - 组装机、离心机、搅拌机、压缩机、切割机、锻压锤、粉碎机、打包机、拆包机、内爆压缩机\n- **[OriTech][ot]**\n  - 原子熔炉、离心机、铸造厂、深井钻机、碎片熔炉、粉碎机、粒子加速器\n- **[Ad Astra][aa]**\n  - 压缩机、合金冶炼炉、锤子\n- **[Applied Energistics 2][ae]**\n  - 转换\n- **[Botania][botania]**\n  - 元素花、烈焰元素花、魔力灌注\n- **[Cyclic][cyclic]**\n  - 破碎机、熔炉、固化器\n- **[Plain Grinder][pg]**\n  - 研磨机\n- **[Simple Grinder][sg]**\n  - 研磨机\n- **[Replication][replication]**\n  - 物质值\n- **[Allthemodium][am]**\n  - 为所有机器提供相关金属的支持\n- **[Immersive Engineering](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering)**\n  - 装瓶机，ATO 添加：[合金冶炼炉、电弧炉、破碎机、金属压模]\n- **[Mekanism](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism)**\n  - ATO 添加：[破碎机、化学结晶器、化学清洗机、注入室、纯化室、富化室、化学转化]\n- **[Ender IO](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-io)**\n  - ATO 添加：[合金冶炼炉、球磨机]\n- **[Actually Additions](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/actually-additions)**\n  - ATO 添加：[破碎机]\n\n----\n\n安装 ATO 后，其他模组中已包含在 ATO 内的矿石应在配置文件中禁用。\n\n**免责声明：** 本模组与我均非 [ATM 团队](https://www.curseforge.com/members/atmteam/projects) 的直属成员。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🎮 我的其他模组！\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"附加结构\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"基岩矿工\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"工具升级\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"全兼容\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"自定义地牢战利品\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"高级工具\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/age-of-weapons\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8e1315b08a3bd1fb144ccd47488b1df4033418ad3aee01e61cc9d6e83fa55a5/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f586d324332576a2e706e67\" alt=\"武器时代\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/RuneCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"符文工艺\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectibles\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Collectibles/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"收藏品\" width=\"85\"/></a> <br> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gems\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExtraGems/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"额外宝石\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/MineTraps/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"矿井陷阱\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exo-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExoCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"外骨骼工艺\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"城市工艺\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"升级改造\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"知识百科\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"枢纽\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"方块侦探\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/suspicious-pots\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Suspicious-Pots/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑花盆\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/message.png?raw=true\" alt=\"消息\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/github_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/xxrexraptorxx\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/kofi_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=75131568\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/patreon_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/discord_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://x.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/xtwitter_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"X\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/FAQ.md\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/wikipedia_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"常见问题解答\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n<br> <br>\n  <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/REXRAPTOR\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/BH_REX_Bisect.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting - 使用代码 REXRAPTOR 享 25% 折扣\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n[ato]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ato\n[alm]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/assemblylinemachines\n[create]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\n[botania]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\n[cyclic]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic\n[ve]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voluminous-energy\n[ir]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-reborn\n[pg]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plain-grinder\n[sg]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-grinder\n[ep]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/energized-power\n[aa]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\n[ic]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-industrial-contraptions-forge\n[mi]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-industrialization\n[ae]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\n[am]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\n[ot]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oritech\n[replication]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/replication",
